WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Start with the header scope, apply Explorer search, then export every matching row across all pages. Here, searching for D5 includes D5.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Keep every device in the applied header scope and loaded snapshot. The briefing includes D5 and D6 in System C, even when Explorer search shows only D5.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Follow a starting CI through its ICT system to dependent services. Package the full traced graph and supporting evidence with the selected scope and snapshot.
